# ============================================================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
# ============================================================================
#
# Local Development:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Update DATABASE_URL with your Supabase credentials
# 3. Run: bun install
# 4. Run: bun run db:generate
# 5. Run: bun run db:push
# 6. Run: bun run dev
#
# Vercel Deployment:
# 1. Add DATABASE_URL, NEXTAUTH_SECRET, NEXTAUTH_URL to Vercel Environment Variables
# 2. Deploy to Vercel
